## Retention checkpoint (2026-10-18 08:41 UTC)
Read-only SSH inspection corrected the earlier assumption that physical
pet-file purge controls the green cycle. snapshot() unions live names
with retained-set names. dg-backup.service runs micro2-backup.sh --keep 24;
the root currently contains exactly the hourly sets 20261017T091717Z
through 20261018T081717Z. The last pet-containing set, 20261017T221711Z,
should naturally rotate out at the 2026-10-18 22:17 producer run. No
backup deletion, retention change, or freshness-logic change is needed.

